Independent Supervisory Authority Reporting Drill
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Build a simple local web form to intake data protection complaints
Investigate a simulated complaint using log analysis techniques
Draft a formal remedial action decision document
Compile annual data protection statistics using a Jupyter notebook
Generate a publishable oversight report in PDF format
Prerequisites
Basic Python (Flask) and command-line familiarity
Understanding of data protection concepts (breach notification, complaint handling, DPIAs)
Basic knowledge of log file structure (timestamps, IP addresses, status codes)
Familiarity with Markdown/Jupyter notebooks
